                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does an EdTech platform cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹25-60 lakh ($30K-72K). Growth: ₹80 lakh - 2 Cr ($96K-240K). Enterprise: ₹2-5 Cr ($240K-600K).</p>
                                        <h3>Live classes or pre-recorded video?</h3>
                                        <p>Blend. Pre-recorded scales; live classes drive engagement + accountability. Best platforms use both.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I compete post-Byju's?</h3>
